    "method": "Static gold labels assigned from the documented briefing and feed contracts before executing the suite; 10 disagreements from a blinded Claude Sonnet 5 review were adjudicated by the repository owner with Claude Opus 4.6 recommendations available. One of those 10 adjudicated cases (health-wrong-status) was later removed as a redundant coverage cut, not for failing; see removed_cases. The remaining 40 cases were owner-reviewed on 2026-08-14. A second blinded model pass by DeepSeek V4 Flash found 12 disagreements; GLM 5.2 arbitrated them, and the repository owner approved all four GLM recommendations that differed from the then-current fixture. Independent reviewer Ree Vu Urtu then completed a randomized, opaque-ID review of all 49 cases and attested that they had not participated in preparation, labeling, or model adjudication and had not inspected prior decisions. That pass produced 38 exact label-set agreements and 11 disagreements. The repository owner human-adjudicated all 11 against the supplied evidence and rubric, with model assistance used to surface rubric conflicts in four decisions. One final label set changed: claim-thin-unsupported added claim_exceeds_evidence alongside unsupported_claim. Those 49 final label sets have completed independent human validation. Six additional checker cases were added afterward from the independent reviewer's coverage recommendations; their labels are owner-selected but provisional pending a new independent pass.",
